# Chains of Mephistopheles: "If a player would draw a card except the first one they draw in each of their draw steps, that
# player discards a card instead. If the player discards a card this way, they draw a card." (CR 614.1a, 121.6) Ancestral
# Recall's three draws are each replaced on their own (CR 121.2, its ruling): for each, Bot1 discards a card of its
# choosing, then draws one - a draw Chains does not replace again (CR 614.5). Bot1 holds two cards when it resolves, discards
# the Forest, the Plains and then the first Island it drew, and ends with two cards drawn this way; three cards have left its
# library.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Chains of Mephistopheles
Ancestral Recall
Forest
Plains
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

